  "notes": [
    "**Desmontar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Multiple meanings:",
    "To dismantle, to take apart: *desmontar un mueble* (to disassemble furniture)",
    "To dismount: *desmontar del caballo* (to dismount from a horse)",
    "To debunk: *desmontar un mito* (to debunk a myth)",
    "Opposite: **montar** (to assemble, to mount, to ride)",
